{"type":"message","id":"0bc892e0","parentId":"c6c6e1a6","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:49:51.456Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-04 18:49 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 2/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: ## Task: 调查并修复并行 CFD 段错误问题\n\n## Workspace: /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter\n\n## Context\n二进制序列化优化后的测试结果：\n- 编译 ✅ 通过\n- 网格剖分 ✅ 通过（接口数据正确传输：44521/44598）\n- 单进程 CFD ✅ 正常收敛\n- **并行 CFD ❌ 段错误崩溃**\n\n错误信息：\n```\n[0]PETSC ERROR: Caught signal number 11 SEGV: Segmentation Violation\napplication called MPI_Abort(MPI_COMM_WORLD, 50176059) - process 0\n```\n\n## 分析要点\n\n### 1. 检查二进制序列化逻辑\n**文件**: `src/metisCutter.cpp`\n\n检查 `packInterfaceBinary()` 和 `unpackInterfaceBinary()`：\n- 缓冲区大小计算是否正确\n- 数据对齐是否正确\n- 边界条件处理\n\n### 2. 检查数据完整性\n接口数据传输成功（44521/44598 个），说明 MPI 通信本身没问题。问题可能在：\n- 数据格式与后续处理不匹配\n- outerFace_ 数据结构更新不完整\n\n### 3. 考虑回退方案\n如果无法快速定位问题，可以：\n- 回退到字符串序列化版本\n- 保留其他已验证的优化\n\n## 修复选项\n\n### 选项 A：修复二进制序列化\n如果问题可以快速定位和修复\n\n### 选项 B：回退二进制序列化\n恢复字符串序列化，确保系统稳定性\n\n## 输出要求\n1. 问题根源分析\n2. 修复方案\n3. 修复后的代码（如适用）\n\n## Report To: $HOME/.openclaw-reports/code-agent/"}],"timestamp":1772621391454}}
{"type":"message","id":"84f5fce6","parentId":"0bc892e0","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:49:58.935Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我需要调查并修复并行 CFD 段错误问题。让我先了解当前的工作空间和代码结构。\n\n根据任务说明：\n- 工作空间：`/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter`\n- 问题：二进制序列化优化后，并行 CFD 出现段错误\n- 编译、网格剖分、单进程 CFD 都正常，只有并行 CFD 崩溃\n\n我需要：\n1. 检查 `src/metisCutter.cpp` 中的 `packInterfaceBinary()` 和 `unpackInterfaceBinary()` 函数\n2. 分析缓冲区大小计算、数据对齐、边界条件处理\n3. 找出问题根源并修复\n\n让我先读取相关文件。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来调查并行 CFD 段错误问题。首先检查二进制序列化相关的代码。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-7779a311419e492cb9bca25da88d1b0a","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.cpp"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":10971,"output":355,"cacheRead":1636,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12962,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772621391456}}
{"type":"message","id":"4e8e51e0","parentId":"84f5fce6","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:49:58.944Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-7779a311419e492cb9bca25da88d1b0a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#include <algorithm>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <cstring>\n#include <ctime>\n#include <numeric>\n\n#include <cgns_io.h>\n#include <parmetis.h>\n\n#include \"cmdLine.h\"\n#include \"metisCutter.h\"\n#include \"mpiAdapter.h\"\n#include \"stringUtil.h\"\n\nstatic const int DataTAG = 1000;\n\nstatic std::vector<idx_t> distribute(const idx_t len, const int n, idx_t &nCellThisRank)\n{\n    vector<idx_t> dist(n + 1, 0);\n    idx_t base = len / n;\n    idx_t remainder = len % n;\n    int rank;\n    MPI_Comm_rank(MPI_COMM_WORLD, &rank);\n    nCellThisRank = base + (rank < remainder ? 1 : 0);\n    MPI_Allgather(&nCellThisRank, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), dist.data() + 1, 1, GetMPIDataType<idx_t>(), MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n    for (int iProc = 1; iProc < n + 1; ++iProc) { dist[iProc] += dist[iProc - 1]; }\n    return dist;\n}\n\nnamespace MeshCut\n{\nMetisCutter::MetisCutter() : bigMesh_(nullptr) {}\n\nMetisCutter::~MetisCutter() {}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::cut(int argc, char **argv)\n{\n    CmdLine cl{};\n    cl.regist<std::string, CmdLine::MustOffer>(\"m\", \"mesh\", \"mesh file name.\", \" \");\n    cl.regist<size_t, CmdLine::MustOffer>(\"np\", \"npart\", \"part number of sub-mesh.\", \" \");\n    cl.parse(argc, argv);\n\n    MPIAdapter::Initialize(&argc, &argv);\n#ifdef DEBUG_MODE\n    if (!MPIAdapter::isParallel() || (MPIAdapter::isParallel() && MPIAdapter::isMaster()))\n    {\n        std::cout << \"DEBUG_MODE: type any char to continue\\n\";\n        auto a = std::getchar();\n    }\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n#endif\n    MPIAdapter::isParallel() ? this->cut_parmetis(cl.get<std::string>(\"mesh\"), cl.get<size_t>(\"npart\")) : this->cut_metis(cl.get<std::string>(\"mesh\"), cl.get<size_t>(\"npart\"));\n}\n\n// Binary pack interface data - efficient serialization\nstd::vector<char> MetisCutter::packInterfaceBinary()\n{\n    std::vector<char> buffer;\n    \n    // Count non-empty entries\n    uint32_t entryCount = 0;\n    for (const auto& ifile : outerFace_) {\n        if (!ifile.second.empty()) {\n            entryCount++;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    // Calculate total size needed\n    size_t totalSize = sizeof(InterfaceMessageHeader);\n    for (const auto& ifile : outerFace_) {\n        if (!ifile.second.empty()) {\n            totalSize += sizeof(InterfaceEntryHeader);\n            totalSize += ifile.second.size() * sizeof(uint64_t);\n        }\n    }\n    \n    buffer.resize(totalSize);\n    char* ptr = buffer.data();\n    \n    // Write header\n    InterfaceMessageHeader* header = reinterpret_cast<InterfaceMessageHeader*>(ptr);\n    header->magic = INTERFACE_MSG_MAGIC;\n    header->version = INTERFACE_MSG_VERSION;\n    header->flags = 0;\n    header->entry_count = entryCount;\n    header->reserved = 0;\n    ptr += sizeof(InterfaceMessageHeader);\n    \n    // Write entries\n    for (const auto& ifile : outerFace_) {\n        if (ifile.second.empty()) continue;\n        \n        InterfaceEntryHeader* entryHeader = reinterpret_cast<InterfaceEntryHeader*>(ptr);\n        entryHeader->file_id = static_cast<int32_t>(ifile.first);\n        entryHeader->face_count = static_cast<uint32_t>(ifile.second.size());\n        ptr += sizeof(InterfaceEntryHeader);\n        \n        // Write face hashes\n        uint64_t* faceHashes = reinterpret_cast<uint64_t*>(ptr);\n        size_t idx = 0;\n        for (const auto& face : ifile.second) {\n            faceHashes[idx++] = static_cast<uint64_t>(face.first);\n        }\n        ptr += ifile.second.size() * sizeof(uint64_t);\n    }\n    \n    return buffer;\n}\n\n// Binary unpack interface data - efficient deserialization\nvoid MetisCutter::unpackInterfaceBinary(const char* data, size_t size)\n{\n    if (size < sizeof(InterfaceMessageHeader)) {\n        return; // Invalid data\n    }\n    \n    const char* ptr = data;\n    \n    // Read header\n    const InterfaceMessageHeader* header = reinterpret_cast<const InterfaceMessageHeader*>(ptr);\n    \n    // Validate magic number and version\n    if (header->magic != INTERFACE_MSG_MAGIC) {\n        check(false, \" \", format(\"  Thread %d: Invalid interface message magic\\n\", RANK));\n        return;\n    }\n    if (header->version != INTERFACE_MSG_VERSION) {\n        check(false, \" \", format(\"  Thread %d: Unsupported interface message version %d\\n\", RANK, header->version));\n        return;\n    }\n    \n    ptr += sizeof(InterfaceMessageHeader);\n    \n    // Read entries\n    for (uint32_t i = 0; i < header->entry_count; ++i) {\n        if (ptr + sizeof(InterfaceEntryHeader) > data + size) {\n            break; // Malformed data\n        }\n        \n        const InterfaceEntryHeader* entryHeader = reinterpret_cast<const InterfaceEntryHeader*>(ptr);\n        ptr += sizeof(InterfaceEntryHeader);\n        \n        int nbrFile = entryHeader->file_id;\n        \n        // Skip if this file is already owned\n        if (ownerFile_.count(nbrFile) != 0) {\n            ptr += entryHeader->face_count * sizeof(uint64_t);\n            continue;\n        }\n        \n        check(true, \" \", format(\"  Thread %d: recv %u interface of file %d\\n\", \n                                RANK, entryHeader->face_count, nbrFile));\n        \n        // Validate remaining data\n        if (ptr + entryHeader->face_count * sizeof(uint64_t) > data + size) {\n            break; // Malformed data\n        }\n        \n        // Read face hashes\n        const uint64_t* faceHashes = reinterpret_cast<const uint64_t*>(ptr);\n        auto& nbrOuterface = outerFace_[nbrFile];\n        for (uint32_t j = 0; j < entryHeader->face_count; ++j) {\n            nbrOuterface.insert({static_cast<size_t>(faceHashes[j]), {}});\n        }\n        \n        ptr += entryHeader->face_count * sizeof(uint64_t);\n    }\n}\n\n// collect interface from all other threads - optimized binary version\nvoid MetisCutter::collect_interface()\n{\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    // Pack interface data using binary format\n    std::vector<char> sendBuffer = packInterfaceBinary();\n    int sendCnt = static_cast<int>(sendBuffer.size());\n\n    // Step 1: Determine which ranks have data to send (non-empty send buffer)\n    std::vector<int> sendCnts(SIZE, 0);\n    sendCnts[RANK] = sendCnt;\n    MPI_Allgather(&sendCnt, 1, MPI_INT, sendCnts.data(), 1, MPI_INT, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n\n    // Step 2: Identify target ranks (those with non-empty data)\n    std::vector<int> targetRanks;\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0) {\n            targetRanks.push_back(i);\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Step 3: Use point-to-point communication only with target ranks\n    std::vector<MPI_Request> requests;\n    std::vector<int> recvCnt(SIZE, 0);\n    std::vector<std::vector<char>> recvBuffers(SIZE);\n    std::vector<char*> recvBuffersPtr(SIZE, nullptr);\n\n    // Post non-blocking receives from all ranks that have data\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0) {\n            recvCnt[i] = sendCnts[i];\n            recvBuffers[i].resize(recvCnt[i]);\n            recvBuffersPtr[i] = recvBuffers[i].data();\n            requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n            MPI_Irecv(recvBuffersPtr[i], recvCnt[i], MPI_CHAR, i, DataTAG + i, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Post non-blocking sends to all ranks that have data\n    if (sendCnt > 0) {\n        for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n            if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0) {\n                requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n                MPI_Isend(sendBuffer.data(), sendCnt, MPI_CHAR, i, RANK + DataTAG, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Wait for all communications to complete\n    if (!requests.empty()) {\n        std::vector<MPI_Status> statuses(requests.size());\n        MPIAdapter::WaitAll(requests.size(), requests.data(), statuses.data());\n    }\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n\n    // Process received data using binary unpack\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i) {\n        if (i != RANK && sendCnts[i] > 0 && !recvBuffers[i].empty()) {\n            unpackInterfaceBinary(recvBuffers[i].data(), recvBuffers[i].size());\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// collect cell id from all other threads\nvector<MetisCutter::Cell> MetisCutter::collect_subBody(const MetisCutter::DecomposeResult &decomposeResult, const vector<int> &ownerThread)\n{\n    map<int, vector<Cell>> cellInfo;\n    {\n        for (idx_t i = 0; i < decomposeResult.nCellThisRank; ++i)\n        {\n            int partId = cellPartition_[i];\n            auto threadId = ownerThread[partId];\n            auto cellId = decomposeResult.start + i;\n            cellInfo[threadId].push_back(Cell{cellId, partId});\n        }\n    }\n    vector<idx_t>{}.swap(cellPartition_); // free\n\n    // all process collect send-recv info from all process\n    vector<long> sendInfo(SIZE, 0), recvInfo(SIZE, 0);\n    {\n        for (auto it : cellInfo)\n        {\n            if (it.first != RANK) sendInfo[it.first] += it.second.size();\n        }\n        MPI_Alltoall(sendInfo.data(), 1, MPI_LONG, recvInfo.data(), 1, MPI_LONG, MPI_COMM_WORLD);\n    }\n\n    // send-recv data\n    MPI_Datatype cellType;\n    {\n        const int cnt = 2;\n        int blockLen[cnt] = {1, 1};\n        MPI_Aint disp[cnt] = {0, sizeof(idx_t)};\n        MPI_Datatype types[cnt] = {MPI_LONG, MPI_INT};\n        MPIAdapter::TypeStruct(cnt, blockLen, disp, types, &cellType);\n        MPIAdapter::TypeCommit(&cellType);\n    }\n    vector<MPI_Request> requests;\n    vector<MPI_Status> statuses;\n    vector<vector<Cell>> recvData;\n    // send\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i)\n    {\n        if (sendInfo[i] != 0)\n        {\n            requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n            MPIAdapter::ISend(cellInfo[i].data(), cellInfo[i].size(), cellType, i, DataTAG + i, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n        }\n    }\n    // recv\n    for (int i = 0; i < SIZE; ++i)\n    {\n        auto recvDataSize = recvInfo[i];\n        if (recvDataSize != 0)\n        {\n            recvData.push_back(vector<Cell>(recvDataSize, Cell{}));\n            requests.push_back(MPI_Request{});\n            MPI_Irecv(recvData.back().data(), recvDataSize, cellType, i, RANK + DataTAG, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &(requests.back()));\n        }\n    }\n    statuses.assign(requests.size(), MPI_Status{});\n    MPIAdapter::WaitAll(requests.size(), requests.data(), statuses.data());\n    requests.clear(), statuses.clear();\n\n    // update cellInfo\n    for (auto &it : recvData)\n    {\n        for (auto &jt : it) cellInfo[RANK].emplace_back(jt);\n    }\n    MPIAdapter::TypeFree(&cellType);\n\n    return cellInfo[RANK];\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::cut_metis(string meshFilename, const int np)\n{\n    // open mesh file to read/write\n    bigMesh_ = std::make_shared<CGFile>(meshFilename);\n    this->updateOwnerThread(meshFilename, np);\n\n    // load body-data into memory from file\n    auto bigBody = bigMesh_->loadSection(bigMesh_->bodySectionIdList());\n\n    check(true, \"\", format(\"Call METIS_V3_PartMeshKway decompose: %s\\n\", bigBody.name));\n    // cut\n    check(cut_metis(bigBody.data, (idx_t)np, cellPartition_, nodePartition_) == METIS_OK, format(\"Call METIS_V3_PartMeshKway decompose: %s return error %s\", bigBody.name), format(\"Call METIS_V3_PartMeshKway decompose: %s successfuly\\n\", bigBody.name));\n\n    // write sub-mesh data to file\n    for (auto ifile = 0; ifile < np; ++ifile)\n    {\n        // open sub-mesh to write\n        this->openSubMeshToWrite(meshFilename, ifile, np);\n\n        // collect cell/node id of sub-mesh\n        nodeIdG2L_.insert({ifile, {}}); // 1-base id\n        nodeIds_.clear();               // 1-base id\n        cellIds_.clear();               // 0-base id\n        for (auto i = 0; i < cellPartition_.size(); ++i)\n        {\n            if (cellPartition_[i] != ifile) continue;\n\n            cellIds_.insert(i + 1);\n            for (auto it : bigBody.cell(i + 1))\n                if (nodeIds_.count(it) == 0) nodeIds_.insert(it);\n        }\n        for (auto it : nodeIds_) nodeIdG2L_[ifile].insert({it, nodeIdG2L_[ifile].size() + 1});\n\n        // write coordinate\n        this->rwNode(ifile);\n\n        // write body-section\n        this->rwBody(ifile, bigBody);\n\n        // write bdy-section\n        this->rwBoundary(ifile);\n\n        // write interface\n        this->rwInterface(ifile);\n\n        // clear\n        for (auto i = 0; i <= ifile; ++i)\n        {\n            if (outerFace_[i].empty())\n            {\n                nodeIdG2L_[i].clear();\n                smallMesh_[i]->close();\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    // clear\n    bigMesh_->close();\n    bigBody.clear();\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::cut_parmetis(string meshFilename, const int np)\n{\n    RANK = MPIAdapter::rank(), SIZE = MPIAdapter::size();\n\n    if (SIZE > np)\n    {\n        if (MPIAdapter::isMaster()) check(true, \"\", format(\"MPI size should not bigger than subMesh number: %d > %d\\n\", SIZE, np));\n\n        MPIAdapter::Finalize();\n        exit(EXIT_SUCCESS);\n    }\n\n    // open mesh file to read/write\n    bigMesh_ = std::make_shared<CGFile>(meshFilename);\n    this->updateOwnerThread(meshFilename, np);\n\n    // handle bodysection\n    auto bigBody = bigMesh_->bodySection();\n\n    // decompose body-section into np parts,\n    // and collect subBody belong to each process\n    auto comPartId = [](const Cell &lhs, const Cell &rhs) { return lhs.partId < rhs.partId; };\n    auto comId = [](const Cell &lhs, const Cell &rhs) { return lhs.id < rhs.id; };\n    auto subBody = collect_subBody(this->decompose_body(bigBody, np), ownerThread_);\n    if (subBody.size() == 0) std::cout << format(\"Thread %d has no subBody\\n\", RANK);\n    std::sort(subBody.begin(), subBody.end(), comPartId);\n    auto pos = subBody.begin();\n    while (pos != subBody.end())\n    {\n        // relod body-section\n        auto lastPos = pos;\n        const auto ifile = lastPos->partId;\n        pos = std::upper_bound(lastPos, subBody.end(), *lastPos, comPartId);\n        std::sort(lastPos, pos, comId);\n        auto indexLB = lastPos->id, indexUB = (pos - 1)->id;\n        auto curBody = bigMesh_->loadSection(bigMesh_->bodySectionIdList(), indexLB, indexUB);\n        // check(true, \"\", format(\"  Thread %d: load %d cells [%d-%d] of part %d\\n\", RANK, indexUB-indexLB+1, indexLB, indexUB, ifile));\n\n        // open sub-mesh file for writing (CRITICAL: must be done before rwNode/rwBody)\n        this->openSubMeshToWrite(meshFilename, ifile, np);\n\n        // cell and node\n        cellIds_.clear(), nodeIds_.clear();\n        for (auto cell : subBody)\n        {\n            if (cell.partId != ifile) continue;\n            cellIds_.insert(cell.id);\n            for (auto it : curBody.cell(cell.id))\n                if (nodeIds_.count(it) == 0) nodeIds_.insert(it);\n        }\n        nodeIdG2L_.insert({ifile, {}});\n        if (!nodeIds_.empty())\n            for (auto it : nodeIds_) nodeIdG2L_[ifile].insert({it, nodeIdG2L_[ifile].size() + 1});\n\n        // write coordinate\n        this->rwNode(ifile);\n\n        // write body\n        this->rwBody(ifile, curBody);\n\n        // write bdy\n        this->rwBoundary(ifile);\n    }\n    bigBody.clear();\n\n    // collect interface\n    this->collect_interface();\n\n    // write interface\n    for (auto ifile : ownerFile_) this->writeInterface(ifile, np);\n\n    // clear\n    bigMesh_->close();\n    for (auto it : smallMesh_)\n        if (it != nullptr) it->close();\n\n    MPIAdapter::Barrier();\n}\n\nint MetisCutter::cut_metis(const vector<vector<idx_t>> &cellToplogy, idx_t np, vector<idx_t> &cellPartition, vector<idx_t> &nodePartition)\n{\n    // metis options\n    idx_t options[METIS_NOPTIONS];\n    options[METIS_OPTION_PTYPE] = METIS_PTYPE_KWAY;\n    options[METIS_OPTION_OBJTYPE] = METIS_OBJTYPE_CUT;\n    options[METIS_OPTION_NUMBERING] = 0;\n    // options[METIS_OPTION_CTYPE] = METIS_CTYPE_SHEM;\n    // options[METIS_OPTION_IPTYPE] = METIS_IPTYPE_EDGE;\n    // options[METIS_OPTION_RTYPE] = METIS_RTYPE_GREEDY;\n    // options[METIS_OPTION_NCUTS] = 1;\n    // options[METIS_OPTION_NITER] = 10;\n    // options[METIS_OPTION_UFACTOR] = 30;\n    METIS_SetDefaultOptions(options);\n\n    // eind-eptr\n    std::vector<idx_t> eind, eptr(cellToplogy.size() + 1, 0);\n    cgsize_t offset = 0;\n    for (auto i = 0; i < cellToplogy.size(); ++i)\n    {\n        for (auto jt : cellToplogy[i]) { eind.push_back(jt - 1); }\n        offset += cellToplogy[i].size();\n        eptr[i + 1] = offset;\n    }\n    idx_t nCell = cellToplogy.size();\n    idx_t nNode = bigMesh_->nNode();\n    cellPartition.assign(nCell, 0);\n    nodePartition.assign(nNode, 0);\n    idx_t ncommon = 4;\n    idx_t objval;\n\n    auto rst = METIS_PartMeshDual(&nCell, &nNode, eptr.data(), eind.data(), NULL, NULL, &ncommon, &np, NULL, options, &objval, cellPartition.data(), nodePartition.data());\n\n    nodePartition.clear();\n    vector<idx_t>{}.swap(nodePartition);\n\n    return rst;\n}\n\nint MetisCutter::cut_parmetis(idx_t np, vector<idx_t> &elmdist, vector<idx_t> &eptr, vector<idx_t> &eind, vector<idx_t> &cellPartition)\n{\n    // parallel read element connectivity data\n    idx_t wgtflag = 0;      // 0: no weights(elmwgt is null), 2: weights on the vertices only\n    idx_t numflag = 0;      // 0: C-style numbering, 1: Fortran-style numbering\n    idx_t ncon = 1;         // the number of weights that each vertex has.\n    idx_t ncommonnodes = 2; // should be greater than 0, 2 is ok for most meshes.\n    idx_t edgecut = 0;\n    idx_t opts[3] = {0, 1, static_cast<idx_t>(std::time(nullptr))};\n    real_t tpwgts[ncon * np];\n    real_t ubvec[ncon];\n\n    for (auto i = 0; i < ncon * np; ++i) { tpwgts[i] = 1.0 / (real_t)np; }\n    for (auto i = 0; i < ncon; ++i) { ubvec[i] = 1.05; }\n\n    MPI_Comm mpi_comm = MPI_COMM_WORLD;\n    return ParMETIS_V3_PartMeshKway(elmdist.data(), eptr.data(), eind.data(),\n                                    NULL, // weights of the elements\n                                    &wgtflag, &numflag, &ncon, &ncommonnodes, &np, tpwgts, ubvec, opts, &edgecut, cellPartition.data(), &mpi_comm);\n}\n\nMetisCutter::DecomposeResult MetisCutter::decompose_body(const CGFile::Section &bigBody, const int np)\n{\n    DecomposeResult result;\n\n    auto elmdist = distribute(bigBody.end - bigBody.start + 1, SIZE, result.nCellThisRank);\n    result.start = bigBody.start + elmdist[RANK];\n\n    auto shareBigbody = bigMesh_->loadSection(bigMesh_->bodySectionIdList(), result.start, result.start + result.nCellThisRank - 1);\n\n    std::vector<idx_t> eind, eptr{0};\n    idx_t beg = shareBigbody.isMixed() ? 1 : 0;\n    for (auto id = result.start; id < result.start + result.nCellThisRank; ++id)\n    {\n        auto &tmp = shareBigbody.cell(id);\n        for (int j = beg; j < tmp.size(); ++j) { eind.push_back(tmp[j] - 1); }\n        eptr.push_back(eptr.back() + tmp.size() - beg);\n    }\n    check(true, \"\", format(\"ParMETIS_V3_PartMeshKway begin divide: %s\\n\", shareBigbody.name));\n    cellPartition_.assign(result.nCellThisRank, 0);\n    check(cut_parmetis(np, elmdist, eptr, eind, cellPartition_) == METIS_OK, format(\"Process %d: ParMETIS_V3_PartMeshKway return error while divide section: %s\\n\", RANK, bigBody.name), format(\"ParMETIS_V3_PartMeshKway done\\n\"));\n\n    return result;\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::updateOwnerThread(string bigFileName, const int np)\n{\n    idx_t dummy;\n\n    // calculate partId collection of each thread\n    ownerThread_.assign(np, 0);\n    {\n        auto tmp = distribute(np, SIZE, dummy);\n        for (auto i = 1; i <= SIZE; ++i)\n        {\n            for (auto j = tmp[i - 1]; j < tmp[i]; ++j) ownerThread_[j] = i - 1;\n        }\n    }\n\n    smallMesh_.assign(np, nullptr);\n    // for(auto i=0; i<np; ++i)\n    // {\n    //     if(ownerThread[i] == RANK)\n    //     {\n    //         smallMesh_[i] = std::make_shared<CGFile>(smallMeshName(bigFileName, i, np), CG_MODE_WRITE);\n    //         ownerFile_.insert(i);\n    //     }\n    // }\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::openSubMeshToWrite(string filename, const int id, const int np)\n{\n    if (ownerThread_[id] == RANK)\n    {\n        smallMesh_[id] = std::make_shared<CGFile>(smallMeshName(filename, id, np), CG_MODE_WRITE);\n        ownerFile_.insert(id);\n    }\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::rwBody(const int ifile, const CGFile::Section &bigBody)\n{\n    auto &subFile = smallMesh_[ifile];\n\n    // new a sectionk\n    auto &curS = subFile->addSection();\n    strcpy(curS.name, bigBody.name);\n    curS.cellType = bigBody.cellType;\n    for (auto id : cellIds_) { curS.addCell(id, bigBody.cell(id), bigBody.flag(id)); }\n\n    // write data\n    subFile->writeSection(curS, nodeIdG2L_[ifile]);\n\n    // global info\n    auto len = curS.end - curS.start + 1;\n    subFile->writeGlobalInfo(curS, bigBody.data.size(), globalOffset_, globalOffset_ + len);\n    globalOffset_ += len;\n\n    // update outerface\n    this->updateOuterFace(curS, ifile);\n\n    // clear\n    curS.clear();\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::rwBoundary(const int ifile)\n{\n    auto &subFile = smallMesh_[ifile];\n    auto &curOuterFace = outerFace_[ifile];\n\n    for (auto ithSection : bigMesh_->bdySectionIdList())\n    {\n        auto &subBdy = subFile->addSection();\n        auto &bigBdy = bigMesh_->loadSection(ithSection);\n        strcpy(subBdy.name, bigBdy.name);\n        subBdy.cellType = bigBdy.cellType;\n\n        cgsize_t ID = bigBdy.start;\n        for (auto i = bigBdy.start; i <= bigBdy.end; ++i)\n        {\n            auto face = bigBdy.cell(i);\n            auto h = hashFace(face);\n            if (curOuterFace.find(h) != curOuterFace.end())\n            {\n                curOuterFace.erase(h);\n                subBdy.addCell(ID++, face, bigBdy.flag(i));\n            }\n        }\n\n        if (!subBdy.data.empty()) subFile->writeSection(subBdy, nodeIdG2L_[ifile]);\n\n        // clear\n        subBdy.clear();\n    }\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::rwInterface(const int id)\n{\n    auto &subFile = smallMesh_[id];\n    auto &curOuterFace = outerFace_[id];\n\n    for (auto nbr = 0; nbr < id; ++nbr)\n    {\n        if (outerFace_[nbr].empty()) continue;\n\n        auto &nbrOuterFace = outerFace_[nbr];\n\n        set<cgsize_t> typeFlags;\n        CGFile::Section curS, nbrS;\n        for (auto face = nbrOuterFace.begin(); face != nbrOuterFace.end();)\n        {\n            auto it = curOuterFace.find(face->first);\n            if (it != curOuterFace.end())\n            {\n                curS.data.emplace_back(it->second);\n                nbrS.data.push_back(face->second);\n\n                auto t = CGFile::CellType(it->second.size(), 2);\n                curS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n                nbrS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n\n                typeFlags.insert(it->second.size());\n\n                it = curOuterFace.erase(it);\n                face = nbrOuterFace.erase(face);\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                ++face;\n            }\n        }\n        if (!curS.data.empty())\n        {\n            strcpy(curS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\", nbr).c_str());\n            strcpy(nbrS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\", id).c_str());\n\n            if (typeFlags.size() > 1)\n            {\n                curS.cellType = ElementType_t::MIXED;\n                nbrS.cellType = ElementType_t::MIXED;\n                auto curOffset = 0;\n                for (auto it : curS.data)\n                {\n                    curS.offset.push_back(curOffset);\n                    nbrS.offset.push_back(curOffset);\n                    curOffset += it.size() + 1;\n                }\n            }\n            else if (typeFlags.size() == 1)\n            {\n                auto type = (*typeFlags.begin() == 3) ? ElementType_t::TRI_3 : ElementType_t::QUAD_4;\n                curS.cellType = type;\n                nbrS.cellType = type;\n            }\n            subFile->writeSection(curS, nodeIdG2L_[id]);\n            smallMesh_[nbr]->writeSection(nbrS, nodeIdG2L_[nbr]);\n        }\n\n        // clear\n        vector<vector<cgsize_t>>{}.swap(curS.data);\n        vector<cgsize_t>{}.swap(curS.offset);\n        vector<cgsize_t>{}.swap(curS.typeFlag);\n    }\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::rwNode(const int ifile)\n{\n    auto &subFile = smallMesh_[ifile];\n\n    // zone info\n    subFile->nCell(cellIds_.size());\n    subFile->nNode(nodeIds_.size());\n\n    // node data\n    auto dataTmp = bigMesh_->loadCoordinate(*nodeIds_.begin(), *nodeIds_.rbegin());\n    vector<vector<double>> data(3, vector<double>(nodeIds_.size(), 0.0));\n    auto start = *nodeIds_.begin();\n    cgsize_t i = 0;\n    for (auto id : nodeIds_)\n    {\n        auto loc = id - start;\n        data[0][i] = dataTmp[0][loc];\n        data[1][i] = dataTmp[1][loc];\n        data[2][i] = dataTmp[2][loc];\n        ++i;\n    }\n    smallMesh_[ifile]->writeCoordinate(data);\n}\n\nstd::string MetisCutter::smallMeshName(string bigMeshName, const int id, const int np)\n{\n    char fmt[128], smallFilename[128];\n    // sprintf(fmt, \"%%s.%d.%%0%dd.cgns\", np, int(std::log10(np) + 1));\n    // sprintf(smallFilename, fmt, bigMeshName.substr(0, bigMeshName.size() - 5).c_str(), id);\n    sprintf(fmt, \"decomposed_mesh_%%0%dd.cgns\", int(std::log10(np) + 1));\n    sprintf(smallFilename, fmt, id);\n\n    return smallFilename;\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::updateOuterFace(const CGFile::Section &curS, const int ifile)\n{\n    auto &curOuterFace = outerFace_[ifile];\n\n    for (auto i = 0; i < curS.data.size(); ++i)\n    {\n        auto cellType = curS.isMixed() ? CGFile::CellType(curS.typeFlag[i]) : curS.cellType;\n        for (auto it : CGFile::allFaceInCell(curS.data[i], cellType))\n        {\n            auto h = hashFace(it);\n            if (curOuterFace.find(h) != curOuterFace.end()) { curOuterFace.erase(h); }\n            else\n            {\n                curOuterFace.insert({h, it});\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::writeGlobalInfo(const CGFile::Section &curS, const int id)\n{\n    auto len = curS.end - curS.start + 1;\n    smallMesh_[id]->writeGlobalInfo(curS, 10, globalOffset_, globalOffset_ + len);\n    globalOffset_ += len;\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::writeInterface(const int id, const int np)\n{\n    auto &subFile = smallMesh_[id];\n    auto &curOuterFace = outerFace_[id];\n\n    for (auto nbr = 0; nbr < np; ++nbr)\n    {\n        if (nbr == id) continue;\n        auto nbrIsOwner = ownerFile_.count(nbr) != 0;\n\n        auto &nbrOuterFace = outerFace_[nbr];\n\n        set<cgsize_t> typeFlags;\n        CGFile::Section curS, nbrS;\n        for (auto face = nbrOuterFace.begin(); face != nbrOuterFace.end();)\n        {\n            auto it = curOuterFace.find(face->first);\n            if (it != curOuterFace.end())\n            {\n                curS.data.emplace_back(it->second);\n                auto t = CGFile::CellType(it->second.size(), 2);\n                curS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n                typeFlags.insert(it->second.size());\n                it = curOuterFace.erase(it);\n\n                if (nbrIsOwner)\n                {\n                    nbrS.data.push_back(face->second);\n                    nbrS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n                    face = nbrOuterFace.erase(face);\n                }\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                ++face;\n            }\n        }\n        if (!curS.data.empty())\n        {\n            strcpy(curS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\", nbr).c_str());\n            if (nbrIsOwner) strcpy(nbrS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\", id).c_str());\n\n            if (typeFlags.size() > 1)\n            {\n                curS.cellType = ElementType_t::MIXED;\n                if (nbrIsOwner) nbrS.cellType = ElementType_t::MIXED;\n            }\n            else if (typeFlags.size() == 1)\n            {\n                auto type = (*typeFlags.begin() == 3) ? ElementType_t::TRI_3 : ElementType_t::QUAD_4;\n                curS.cellType = type;\n                if (nbrIsOwner) nbrS.cellType = type;\n            }\n            subFile->writeSection(curS, nodeIdG2L_[id]);\n            if (nbrIsOwner) smallMesh_[nbr]->writeSection(nbrS, nodeIdG2L_[nbr]);\n        }\n\n        // clear\n        vector<vector<cgsize_t>>{}.swap(curS.data);\n        vector<cgsize_t>{}.swap(curS.offset);\n        vector<cgsize_t>{}.swap(curS.typeFlag);\n    }\n}\n\n} // namespace MeshCut\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772621398942}}
{"type":"message","id":"0221190b","parentId":"4e8e51e0","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:50:03.131Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"让我检查一下二进制序列化的头文件定义，看看是否有对齐或结构定义问题。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-d47161bb24e546ccb6f6f2a61f44929a","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.h"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":11482,"output":67,"cacheRead":8697,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20246,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772621398944}}
{"type":"message","id":"22a97bf9","parentId":"0221190b","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:50:03.136Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-d47161bb24e546ccb6f6f2a61f44929a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#pragma once\n\n#include <memory>\n#include <unordered_map>\n#include <map>\n#include <functional>\n#include <cstdint>\n#include <vector>\n\n#ifdef SUPPORT_METIS\n#include <metis.h>\n#else \n    typedef int64_t idx_t;\n#endif\n\n#include \"meshCutter.h\"\n#include \"cgFile.h\"\n\nusing std::map;\nusing std::unordered_map;\n\n// ============================================================================\n// Binary message format for interface data serialization\n// ============================================================================\n#pragma pack(push, 1)\nstruct InterfaceMessageHeader {\n    uint32_t magic;       // Magic number: 0x494E5446 (\"INTF\")\n    uint16_t version;     // Version: 0x0001\n    uint16_t flags;       // Reserved flags\n    uint32_t entry_count; // Number of file entries\n    uint32_t reserved;    // Reserved for alignment (total 16 bytes)\n};\n\nstruct InterfaceEntryHeader {\n    int32_t  file_id;     // File ID (key in outerFace_)\n    uint32_t face_count;  // Number of face hashes\n    // Followed by face_count * uint64_t (face hash values)\n};\n#pragma pack(pop)\n\n// Magic number constant\nconstexpr uint32_t INTERFACE_MSG_MAGIC = 0x494E5446; // \"INTF\"\nconstexpr uint16_t INTERFACE_MSG_VERSION = 0x0001;\n\n// Hash function for face (vector of cgsize_t)\ninline size_t hashFace(const vector<cgsize_t>& face) {\n    size_t h = 0;\n    for (auto id : face)\n        h ^= std::hash<cgsize_t>{}(id) + 0x9e3779b9 + (h << 6) + (h >> 2);\n    return h;\n}\n\n\nnamespace MeshCut\n{\nclass MetisCutter : public MeshCutter\n{\npublic:\n    MetisCutter();\n    virtual ~MetisCutter();\n\npublic:\n    void cut(int argc, char** argv) override;\n\nprivate:\n    using cgns_filetype = std::shared_ptr<CGFile>;\n    int RANK = 0, SIZE = 1;\n    cgns_filetype bigMesh_;\n    vector<cgns_filetype> smallMesh_;\n    map<int, map<cgsize_t, cgsize_t>> nodeIdG2L_;\n    set<cgsize_t> nodeIds_, cellIds_;\n    vector<idx_t> cellPartition_, nodePartition_;\n    unordered_map<int, unordered_map<size_t, vector<cgsize_t>>> outerFace_;\n    cgsize_t globalOffset_ = 0;\n    set<int> ownerFile_;\n    struct DecomposeResult\n    {\n        idx_t nCellThisRank, start;\n    };\n    struct Cell\n    {\n        idx_t id;   // begin from 1\n        int partId; // begin from 0;\n    };\n    vector<int> ownerThread_;\n\nprivate:\n    void collect_interface();\n    \n    // Binary serialization for interface data\n    std::vector<char> packInterfaceBinary();\n    void unpackInterfaceBinary(const char* data, size_t size);\n    \n    vector<Cell> collect_subBody(const DecomposeResult& decomposeResult, const vector<int>& ownerThread);\n\n    void cut_metis(string mesh, const int np);\n\n    int cut_metis(const vector<vector<idx_t>>& cellToplogy, idx_t np, vector<idx_t>& cellPartition, vector<idx_t>& nodePartition);\n\n    void cut_parmetis(string mesh, const int np);\n\n    int cut_parmetis(idx_t np, vector<idx_t>& elmdist, vector<idx_t>& eptr, vector<idx_t>& eind, vector<idx_t>& cellPartition);\n\n    DecomposeResult decompose_body(const CGFile::Section& bigBody, const int np);\n\n    void updateOwnerThread(string filename, const int np);\n\n    void openSubMeshToWrite(string filename, const int id, const int np);\n\n    void rwBody(const int ifile, const CGFile::Section& bigBody);\n\n    void rwBoundary(const int ifile);\n\n    void rwInterface(const int ifile);\n\n    void rwNode(const int ifile);\n\n    std::string smallMeshName(string bigMeshName, const int id, const int np);\n\n    void updateOuterFace(const CGFile::Section& curS, const int id);\n\n    void writeGlobalInfo(const CGFile::Section& curS, const int id);\n\n    void writeInterface(const int ifile, const int np);\n};\n} // namespace MeshCut\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772621403134}}
{"type":"message","id":"10f94199","parentId":"22a97bf9","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:50:18.561Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I need to analyze the binary serialization logic. Let me check the key issue:\n\n1. In `packInterfaceBinary()`, the function iterates over `outerFace_` and packs the face hashes.\n2. In `unpackInterfaceBinary()`, the function reads the packed data and inserts into `outerFace_[nbrFile]`.\n\nThe critical issue I see is in `unpackInterfaceBinary()`:\n- It inserts into `outerFace_[nbrFile]` with `nbrOuterface.insert({static_cast<size_t>(faceHashes[j]), {}});`\n- This creates entries with **empty vectors** for the face data\n\nBut wait, looking at the original code flow in `writeInterface()`:\n- It expects `outerFace_[nbr]` to contain face data (vectors of cgsize_t)\n- But the binary unpack only stores the hash key with an **empty vector**!\n\nThis is the root cause! The binary serialization only serializes the **hash keys** (size_t), but not the actual **face data** (vector<cgsize_t>). After unpacking, the outerFace_ entries have empty face vectors, which will cause issues when `writeInterface()` tries to use them.\n\nLet me verify by looking at the `writeInterface()` function again:\n\n```cpp\nfor (auto face = nbrOuterFace.begin(); face != nbrOuterFace.end();)\n{\n    auto it = curOuterFace.find(face->first);\n    if (it != curOuterFace.end())\n    {\n        curS.data.emplace_back(it->second);  // Uses it->second (face vector)\n        ...\n        if (nbrIsOwner)\n        {\n            nbrS.data.push_back(face->second);  // Uses face->second (face vector)\n            ...\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\nWhen `it->second` and `face->second` are empty vectors, the interface sections get written with empty face data, which could trigger memory access errors or corruption in the CGNS library during the parallel CFD execution.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在让我查看 Git 历史，找