{"type":"message","id":"35e17c74","parentId":"bc844e90","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:50:47.498Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can see the issue. The original code used string serialization and `MPI_Alltoallv`, but the new binary version uses a different communication pattern. Let me analyze the differences:\n\n1. Original string version: Uses `MPI_Alltoallv` to send the same data to all processes (each process broadcasts its interface data to all others)\n\n2. New binary version: Uses point-to-point `MPI_Isend` and `MPI_Irecv` with different tag patterns\n\nThere's a critical issue in the new binary version - the tag usage is inconsistent:\n\nIn the send:\n```cpp\nMPI_Isend(sendBuffer.data(), sendCnt, MPI_CHAR, i, RANK + DataTAG, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n```\nTag is `RANK + DataTAG` (sender's rank + DataTAG)\n\nIn the receive:\n```cpp\nMPI_Irecv(recvBuffersPtr[i], recvCnt[i], MPI_CHAR, i, DataTAG + i, MPI_COMM_WORLD, &requests.back());\n```\nTag is `DataTAG + i` (sender's rank + DataTAG)\n\nSo for rank 0 sending to rank 1:\n- Send tag: `0 + 1000 = 1000`\n- Expected receive tag: `1000 + 1 = 1001`\n\nThis is a tag mismatch! But actually, looking more carefully:\n- Send from rank 0 to rank 1: tag = `0 + 1000 = 1000`\n- Receive from rank 0 at rank 1: tag = `1000 + 0 = 1000` (since i=0 is the source)\n\nWait, let me re-read:\n- For rank i sending: `MPI_Isend(..., i, RANK + DataTAG, ...)` where RANK is my rank\n- For rank i receiving: `MPI_Irecv(..., i, DataTAG + i, ...)` where i is the source rank\n\n\nThe receive side actually uses the source rank to compute the tag, so the tags align properly. I need to examine the data flow more carefully - the unpacking logic seems to be where the actual problem lies.\n\nWhen reconstructing `outerFace_`, the code iterates through entries from the header and reconstitutes each `nbrFile` entry by hashing faces into a vector. The issue might not be in the MPI communication itself, but rather in how the data gets deserialized afterward. I should check what happens after `collect_interface()` completes and trace the data flow through `writeInterface()`.\n\nThe face hash is stored as a key with an empty vector as its value, but I need to verify how the original string version handled this. Looking at the unpack logic, it's doing the same thing - creating an entry with an empty vector for each face hash. This means the reconstruction approach is actually consistent between both versions, so the problem must lie elsewhere.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"让我查看原始版本中 `outerFace_` 的更新逻辑："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-5cdd472843b04d6f8f2a199484436599","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter && git show HEAD~1:src/metisCutter.cpp | grep -A 100 \"void MetisCutter::updateOuterFace\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":1539,"output":1254,"cacheRead":23523,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26316,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772621425109}}
{"type":"message","id":"cbe079ec","parentId":"35e17c74","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:50:47.511Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-5cdd472843b04d6f8f2a199484436599","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"void MetisCutter::updateOuterFace(const CGFile::Section &curS, const int ifile)\n{\n    auto &curOuterFace = outerFace_[ifile];\n\n    for (auto i = 0; i < curS.data.size(); ++i)\n    {\n        auto cellType = curS.isMixed() ? CGFile::CellType(curS.typeFlag[i]) : curS.cellType;\n        for (auto it : CGFile::allFaceInCell(curS.data[i], cellType))\n        {\n            auto val = CGFile::stringAFace(it);\n            if (curOuterFace.find(val) != curOuterFace.end()) { curOuterFace.erase(val); }\n            else\n            {\n                curOuterFace.insert({val, it});\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::writeGlobalInfo(const CGFile::Section &curS, const int id)\n{\n    auto len = curS.end - curS.start + 1;\n    smallMesh_[id]->writeGlobalInfo(curS, 10, globalOffset_, globalOffset_ + len);\n    globalOffset_ += len;\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::writeInterface(const int id, const int np)\n{\n    auto &subFile = smallMesh_[id];\n    auto &curOuterFace = outerFace_[id];\n\n    for (auto nbr = 0; nbr < np; ++nbr)\n    {\n        if (nbr == id) continue;\n        auto nbrIsOwner = ownerFile_.count(nbr) != 0;\n\n        auto &nbrOuterFace = outerFace_[nbr];\n\n        set<cgsize_t> typeFlags;\n        CGFile::Section curS, nbrS;\n        for (auto face = nbrOuterFace.begin(); face != nbrOuterFace.end();)\n        {\n            auto it = curOuterFace.find(face->first);\n            if (it != curOuterFace.end())\n            {\n                curS.data.emplace_back(it->second);\n                auto t = CGFile::CellType(it->second.size(), 2);\n                curS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n                typeFlags.insert(it->second.size());\n                it = curOuterFace.erase(it);\n\n                if (nbrIsOwner)\n                {\n                    nbrS.data.push_back(face->second);\n                    nbrS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n                    face = nbrOuterFace.erase(face);\n                }\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                ++face;\n            }\n        }\n        if (!curS.data.empty())\n        {\n            strcpy(curS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\", nbr).c_str());\n            if (nbrIsOwner) strcpy(nbrS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\", id).c_str());\n\n            if (typeFlags.size() > 1)\n            {\n                curS.cellType = ElementType_t::MIXED;\n                if (nbrIsOwner) nbrS.cellType = ElementType_t::MIXED;\n            }\n            else if (typeFlags.size() == 1)\n            {\n                auto type = (*typeFlags.begin() == 3) ? ElementType_t::TRI_3 : ElementType_t::QUAD_4;\n                curS.cellType = type;\n                if (nbrIsOwner) nbrS.cellType = type;\n            }\n            subFile->writeSection(curS, nodeIdG2L_[id]);\n            if (nbrIsOwner) smallMesh_[nbr]->writeSection(nbrS, nodeIdG2L_[nbr]);\n        }\n\n        // clear\n        vector<vector<cgsize_t>>{}.swap(curS.data);\n        vector<cgsize_t>{}.swap(curS.offset);\n        vector<cgsize_t>{}.swap(curS.typeFlag);\n    }\n}\n\n} // namespace MeshCut"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":8,"aggregated":"void MetisCutter::updateOuterFace(const CGFile::Section &curS, const int ifile)\n{\n    auto &curOuterFace = outerFace_[ifile];\n\n    for (auto i = 0; i < curS.data.size(); ++i)\n    {\n        auto cellType = curS.isMixed() ? CGFile::CellType(curS.typeFlag[i]) : curS.cellType;\n        for (auto it : CGFile::allFaceInCell(curS.data[i], cellType))\n        {\n            auto val = CGFile::stringAFace(it);\n            if (curOuterFace.find(val) != curOuterFace.end()) { curOuterFace.erase(val); }\n            else\n            {\n                curOuterFace.insert({val, it});\n            }\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::writeGlobalInfo(const CGFile::Section &curS, const int id)\n{\n    auto len = curS.end - curS.start + 1;\n    smallMesh_[id]->writeGlobalInfo(curS, 10, globalOffset_, globalOffset_ + len);\n    globalOffset_ += len;\n}\n\nvoid MetisCutter::writeInterface(const int id, const int np)\n{\n    auto &subFile = smallMesh_[id];\n    auto &curOuterFace = outerFace_[id];\n\n    for (auto nbr = 0; nbr < np; ++nbr)\n    {\n        if (nbr == id) continue;\n        auto nbrIsOwner = ownerFile_.count(nbr) != 0;\n\n        auto &nbrOuterFace = outerFace_[nbr];\n\n        set<cgsize_t> typeFlags;\n        CGFile::Section curS, nbrS;\n        for (auto face = nbrOuterFace.begin(); face != nbrOuterFace.end();)\n        {\n            auto it = curOuterFace.find(face->first);\n            if (it != curOuterFace.end())\n            {\n                curS.data.emplace_back(it->second);\n                auto t = CGFile::CellType(it->second.size(), 2);\n                curS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n                typeFlags.insert(it->second.size());\n                it = curOuterFace.erase(it);\n\n                if (nbrIsOwner)\n                {\n                    nbrS.data.push_back(face->second);\n                    nbrS.typeFlag.push_back(t);\n                    face = nbrOuterFace.erase(face);\n                }\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                ++face;\n            }\n        }\n        if (!curS.data.empty())\n        {\n            strcpy(curS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\", nbr).c_str());\n            if (nbrIsOwner) strcpy(nbrS.name, format(\"Interface_%d\", id).c_str());\n\n            if (typeFlags.size() > 1)\n            {\n                curS.cellType = ElementType_t::MIXED;\n                if (nbrIsOwner) nbrS.cellType = ElementType_t::MIXED;\n            }\n            else if (typeFlags.size() == 1)\n            {\n                auto type = (*typeFlags.begin() == 3) ? ElementType_t::TRI_3 : ElementType_t::QUAD_4;\n                curS.cellType = type;\n                if (nbrIsOwner) nbrS.cellType = type;\n            }\n            subFile->writeSection(curS, nodeIdG2L_[id]);\n            if (nbrIsOwner) smallMesh_[nbr]->writeSection(nbrS, nodeIdG2L_[nbr]);\n        }\n\n        // clear\n        vector<vector<cgsize_t>>{}.swap(curS.data);\n        vector<cgsize_t>{}.swap(curS.offset);\n        vector<cgsize_t>{}.swap(curS.typeFlag);\n    }\n}\n\n} // namespace MeshCut","cwd":"/home/one/.openclaw/agents/code-agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1772621447509}}
{"type":"message","id":"82d4053d","parentId":"cbe079ec","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:50:54.056Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我找到了问题！\n\n在原始版本中，`updateOuterFace` 使用的是字符串作为键：\n```cpp\nauto val = CGFile::stringAFace(it);\nif (curOuterFace.find(val) != curOuterFace.end()) { curOuterFace.erase(val); }\nelse\n{\n    curOuterFace.insert({val, it});\n}\n```\n\n而在新版本中，改成了使用哈希值：\n```cpp\nauto h = hashFace(it);\nif (curOuterFace.find(h) != curOuterFace.end()) { curOuterFace.erase(h); }\nelse\n{\n    curOuterFace.insert({h, it});\n}\n```\n\n这看起来没问题，但关键问题是：`outerFace_` 的类型变了！\n\n让我检查一下旧版本的头文件：","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-de371c0ae3de461d960db21ba6ed6291","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter && git show HEAD~1:src/metisCutter.h"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":838,"output":349,"cacheRead":25060,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26247,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772621447511}}
