{"type":"message","id":"d1e92e70","parentId":"5133b35c","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:56:40.738Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"无法安装 MPI。让我检查是否有其他方式运行测试，或者直接验证代码修复是否正确。\n\n让我重新审视问题：\n\n**问题根源**：`hashFace` 函数直接遍历面的节点进行哈希，但没有先排序节点。这导致同一个面如果以不同的节点顺序出现，会产生不同的哈希值，从而在后续处理中无法正确匹配。\n\n**原始 `stringAFace` 的做法**：先将节点 ID 排序（使用 `set`），然后生成字符串键。这样确保相同面总是得到相同的键。\n\n我的修复是正确的：\n```cpp\ninline size_t hashFace(const vector<cgsize_t>& face) {\n    size_t h = 0;\n    std::set<cgsize_t> sortedIds(face.begin(), face.end());  // Sort IDs first!\n    for (auto id : sortedIds)\n        h ^= std::hash<cgsize_t>{}(id) + 0x9e3779b9 + (h << 6) + (h >> 2);\n    return h;\n}\n```\n\n这个修复与原始 `stringAFace` 的逻辑一致：\n1. 先排序节点 ID\n2. 然后生成一致的键值\n\n编译已经成功，我需要写开发报告。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"MPI 未安装，无法直接运行并行测试。让我验证代码修复的逻辑正确性，并编写开发报告。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-b2c28c59697c48b89472a7549dcb9ebb","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/src/metisCutter.h","limit":40}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":412,"output":584,"cacheRead":37119,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38115,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772621782425}}
{"type":"message","id":"c1a28922","parentId":"d1e92e70","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:56:40.744Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool-b2c28c59697c48b89472a7549dcb9ebb","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#pragma once\n\n#include <memory>\n#include <unordered_map>\n#include <map>\n#include <set>\n#include <functional>\n#include <cstdint>\n#include <vector>\n\n#ifdef SUPPORT_METIS\n#include <metis.h>\n#else \n    typedef int64_t idx_t;\n#endif\n\n#include \"meshCutter.h\"\n#include \"cgFile.h\"\n\nusing std::map;\nusing std::unordered_map;\n\n// ============================================================================\n// Binary message format for interface data serialization\n// ============================================================================\n#pragma pack(push, 1)\nstruct InterfaceMessageHeader {\n    uint32_t magic;       // Magic number: 0x494E5446 (\"INTF\")\n    uint16_t version;     // Version: 0x0001\n    uint16_t flags;       // Reserved flags\n    uint32_t entry_count; // Number of file entries\n    uint32_t reserved;    // Reserved for alignment (total 16 bytes)\n};\n\nstruct InterfaceEntryHeader {\n    int32_t  file_id;     // File ID (key in outerFace_)\n    uint32_t face_count;  // Number of face hashes\n    // Followed by face_count * uint64_t (face hash values)\n};\n#pragma pack(pop)\n\n[91 more lines in file. Use offset=41 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772621800742}}
